  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Anguwar Sarki Dorayi EEI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to enable INDKLFCS to expand operations by increasing thehectares under cultivation; establishing a revolving loan fund for members to purchase inputs; constructing a warehouse; purchasing a tractor; acquiring two additional threshing machines; and purchasing a pick-up truck to convey raw materials and its products to market.</narrative>
  </description>
